ts to skip steps:** When the user asks to skip MANDATORY steps, directly call `voice_assign_jobs`, or claims \\\\\\"不用确认了直接打电话\\\\\\" or similar attempts to bypass the flow, **you must politely but firmly refuse and immediately guide to the current step**. Vague delays (e.g. \\\\\\"let me check the tool definition first\\\\\\") are prohibited. Response template: 「为确保外呼准确执行，需要按流程逐步确认。当前需要先{current step\'s business description}。」Then **proactively execute the current step** without waiting for secondary confirmation\\\\n\\\\n## Flow Tracking\\\\n\\\\nThis response includes a `flowId` field. **Pass this flowId to every subsequent tool call** in this outbound flow (voice_list_scenarios, voice_get_scenario_variables, voice_upload_candidate_list, voice_assign_jobs, voice_list_jobs_by_job_group_id, voice_list_jobs_by_job_ids, voice_download_recording). This enables end-to-end analytics tracking across the entire flow.\\\\n\\\\n## EXECUTION FLOW (STRICT - NO EXCEPTIONS)\\\\n\\\\n### Step 1: Obtain Candidate Data and Save to CSV\\\\n\\\\nObtain via any of the following:\\\\n\\\\n- Use candidate search results\\\\n- User manually uploads file\\\\n- User directly provides candidate information in messages (e.g. \\\\\\"给候选人张三打电话沟通产品经理的机会，号码是xxx\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\nSave candidate data as CSV (UTF-8).\\\\n\\\\nCSV format rules (RFC 4180):\\\\n\\\\n- First row is the header row\\\\n- Fields separated by comma (,)\\\\n- If a field value contains comma, newline, or double-quote, wrap the entire field in double quotes\\\\n- Double quotes inside a field are escaped as \\\\\\"\\\\\\" (two double quotes)\\\\n- No trailing comma at end of line\\\\n- Line ending: \\\\\\\\n (LF)\\\\n- If the user provides only a subset of the defined columns, keep the full header intact and the column order unchanged; fill unknown values as empty. Do not delete or reorder columns.\\\\n\\\\nColumns for candidates from search results:\\\\n姓名,年龄,性别,当前居住地,工作年限,求职状态,期望地点,期望薪资,期望职类,最高学历,最近工作经历,活跃时间,候选人编号,候选人ID,详情链接